tive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is not an equivalence relation since it's neither reflexive nor symmetric nor transitive.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"None.\"</p>\n</div>",
